    {
      "subId": "4000309",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the stranger",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400030901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400030901": {
            "id": "400030901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030902"
            ]
          },
          "400030902": {
            "id": "400030902",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030903"
            ]
          },
          "400030903": {
            "id": "400030903",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hey {NICKNAME}, Paimon reckons this guy is gonna make a difficult conversation partner...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030904"
            ]
          },
          "400030904": {
            "id": "400030904",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If Paimon was gonna hazard a guess, Paimon would say he's definitely not one of the good guys!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030905"
            ]
          },
          "400030905": {
            "id": "400030905",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Your hazardous guesswork is a woefully insufficient means of judging between good and evil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030906"
            ]
          },
          "400030906": {
            "id": "400030906",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Nevertheless, you surmise correctly. I am a malevolent spirit. A guardian yaksha, slaughterer of monsters and vanquisher of demons - Xiao.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030907"
            ]
          },
          "400030907": {
            "id": "400030907",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Guardian Yaksha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030910"
            ]
          },
          "400030910": {
            "id": "400030910",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes... Someone from Liyue was telling us that yakshas are also a kind of adeptus. Supernatural beings that protect Liyue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030911"
            ]
          },
          "400030911": {
            "id": "400030911",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They stand guard over the human world in secret, protecting it from monsters and demons. But most people don't even know they exist.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030912"
            ]
          },
          "400030912": {
            "id": "400030912",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Wait, doesn't that make you the good guys by most definitions?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030913"
            ]
          },
          "400030913": {
            "id": "400030913",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "...No. Do not mistake the yakshas' guardianship for some sort of good will towards humanity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030914"
            ]
          },
          "400030914": {
            "id": "400030914",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmph, charming! There's a whole city of humans out there working hard to prepare for Lantern Rite, all for the sake of honoring the heroes of Liyue's history...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030915"
            ]
          },
          "400030915": {
            "id": "400030915",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Turns out we have here an actual historical hero, who has miraculously survived through to this day... and yet, he doesn't even appreciate the gesture!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030916"
            ]
          },
          "400030916": {
            "id": "400030916",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030917"
            ]
          },
          "400030917": {
            "id": "400030917",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, Mr. Xiao... Uh, that is, assuming \"Mr.\" is the correct way to address an adeptus... Why didn't you stop that shady character earlier?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030918"
            ]
          },
          "400030918": {
            "id": "400030918",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "I sensed a malign influence here. I'm here to investigate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030919"
            ]
          },
          "400030919": {
            "id": "400030919",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "When a shackle is loosened in the realms of deities and demons, I take full responsibility.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030920"
            ]
          },
          "400030920": {
            "id": "400030920",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "But this time, the threat comes from the mortal world — your world. Thus you shall take full responsibility, mortal traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030921"
            ]
          },
          "400030921": {
            "id": "400030921",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "When the time comes, I hope you shall act promptly and decisively...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030922"
            ]
          },
          "400030922": {
            "id": "400030922",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "I do not wish for the tassel of the polearm that has slaughtered countless demons to become stained with mortal blood.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030923"
            ]
          },
          "400030923": {
            "id": "400030923",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030924"
            ]
          },
          "400030924": {
            "id": "400030924",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "A symbol that your suspected evildoer left behind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030925"
            ]
          },
          "400030925": {
            "id": "400030925",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Paimon, do you recognize it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030926"
            ]
          },
          "400030926": {
            "id": "400030926",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Doesn't look familiar to Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030927"
            ]
          },
          "400030927": {
            "id": "400030927",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Well, you will have to show me how much you can accomplish on your own strength.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030928"
            ]
          },
          "400030928": {
            "id": "400030928",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Because if I become involved, there is a possibility that the streets of Liyue Harbor will be painted red this Lantern Rite.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030929"
            ]
          },
          "400030929": {
            "id": "400030929",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Actually, quite a festive color in this part of the world...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030930"
            ]
          },
          "400030930": {
            "id": "400030930",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That sounds terrible!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400030932"
            ]
          },
          "400030932": {
            "id": "400030932",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ahh, let's not be impulsive. Why don't we figure out the origins of this symbol first?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}